      "resolvable": false,
      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 463418109,
          "type": null,
          "body": "Looks like these exact code lines come from commit 094297ec77a28a38310d9449cd4f700163434022 by @realrichardsharpe. The length update was wrong anyway, and I do not see how FCS could be part of the reassembled frame since all fragments put in the fragments list have the FCS field removed already.",
